## Skip Navigation (SC 2.4.1)

Allows keyboard users to bypass repeated navigation blocks.

```html
<!-- First element in <body> -->
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>

<!-- Visually hidden until focused -->
